'''Melon seeds'''{{fn|Also known as '''watermelon seeds''' in [[Language#Differences between English variants|New Zealand English]].}} are items obtained from [[melon slice]]s that can be used to grow melon stems.

'''Melon stems''' are plants grown on [[farmland]] that, over time, grow [[melon]]s on dirt, mud and moss blocks adjacent to them.

