An '''activator rail''' is a type of [[rail]] that, if [[powered]], can eject [[entities]] from regular [[minecart]]s, lock [[hopper minecart]]s, ignite [[TNT minecart]]s, and activate the command in a [[command block minecart]]. If not powered, it can only unlock locked hopper minecarts.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
The correct tool to break an activator rail is a [[pickaxe]]. It will always drop itself when broken, regardless of the tool used.
{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Activator Rail|Pickaxe}}
